WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 11]

01:44.979 --> 01:47.060
How dare you come back?

01:51.539 --> 01:52.870
You lost the Moon Sword.

01:54.380 --> 01:56.300
And now you are begging me to save Liu Shao.

01:56.300 --> 01:58.620
Tell me, why should I save her?

01:59.020 --> 02:01.020
I want to know the truth from Master.

02:01.100 --> 02:02.330
Back then, you asked me to escort Liu Shao

02:02.330 --> 02:03.990
to Marquis Wuyang's Mansion.

02:04.180 --> 02:05.220
The real purpose

02:05.660 --> 02:06.780
is that she is the only one

02:06.780 --> 02:08.979
that can pull out the Moon Sword, right?

02:13.940 --> 02:14.420
Yes.

02:18.620 --> 02:20.880
You don't allow me to fall in love with her

02:20.980 --> 02:21.579
because you know

02:21.579 --> 02:24.180
she would die after pulling out the Moon Sword.

02:26.020 --> 02:27.860
What else do you know?

02:28.780 --> 02:29.780
Rumour has it that

02:30.980 --> 02:33.780
the Moon Sword is the weapon of God of the Moonlight.

02:33.780 --> 02:35.440
During the Battle of Two Gods,

02:35.660 --> 02:38.620
God of the Sun sealed the Moon Sword in the mortal world.

02:38.620 --> 02:41.140
But Liu Shao can break the seal and pull out the sword.

02:41.140 --> 02:43.940
And she conflicts with the power of the Moon Sword.

02:44.940 --> 02:47.200
Then the mysterious light in her body...

02:47.460 --> 02:48.260
That's right.

02:48.460 --> 02:50.780
It's the divine spirit of God of the Sun.

02:54.820 --> 02:55.740
So,

02:57.780 --> 03:00.380
I'm protecting the inheritor of God of the Sun?

03:04.020 --> 03:06.460
But do you know who you are?

03:10.060 --> 03:13.060
Why did you see the Battle of Two Gods in the illusion

03:13.700 --> 03:16.020
as if it is your own experience?

03:16.020 --> 03:17.020
Lu Li.

03:19.500 --> 03:21.760
Because the half of the heart in your body

03:21.780 --> 03:23.660
belongs to God of the Moonlight.

03:26.940 --> 03:29.860
And God of the Moonlight and God of the Sun

03:32.860 --> 03:34.530
are destined enemies.

03:36.060 --> 03:38.420
You only have half a heart

03:39.100 --> 03:40.380
because God of the Sun

03:40.900 --> 03:43.740
split God of the Moonlight's heart into half.

03:45.220 --> 03:48.420
Half of it is suppressed under the Four Seasons Monument.

03:48.820 --> 03:51.940
Half of it turned into you.

03:53.550 --> 03:56.960
You and Liu Shao inherited the hatred of the two gods.

03:59.380 --> 04:01.920
That's why your spiritual power will oppose each other

04:01.920 --> 04:03.540
and hurt each other.

04:07.240 --> 04:09.150
If you lack the other half of heart,

04:09.150 --> 04:12.750
you can only be the shadow of God of the Moonlight in mortal world.

04:14.300 --> 04:16.300
You will disappear one day.

04:16.980 --> 04:18.899
I want you to live

04:21.100 --> 04:23.220
and God of the Moonlight to come back.

04:24.020 --> 04:26.420
That's why I asked you to get the Moon Sword.

04:27.180 --> 04:28.710
Only by using the Moon Sword

04:28.820 --> 04:30.420
to break the Four Seasons Monument,

04:30.420 --> 04:31.420
can you get back

04:31.420 --> 04:33.980
the other half of your heart under the monument

04:33.980 --> 04:36.620
and become God of the Moonlight completely.

04:38.180 --> 04:39.040
Master,

04:41.180 --> 04:42.720
did you already know that

04:45.300 --> 04:47.260
if I become God of the Moonlight,

04:48.020 --> 04:49.580
Liu Shao will die.

04:51.700 --> 04:53.300
So what?

04:54.420 --> 04:56.950
As long as you can become God of the Moonlight,

04:57.380 --> 04:58.980
nothing else matters.

05:05.020 --> 05:07.100
I'll give you one last chance.

05:07.780 --> 05:09.980
Get back the Moon Sword from Liu Shao.

05:12.260 --> 05:13.260
Otherwise,

05:14.620 --> 05:16.550
there is nothing you can do but die.

05:18.820 --> 05:19.620
Lu Li!

05:29.020 --> 05:29.700
Liu Shao.

05:31.140 --> 05:31.900
It's me.

05:50.740 --> 05:51.620
Liu Shao.

05:51.620 --> 05:53.820
You mustn't use your vitality anymore.

05:55.180 --> 05:56.180
Here.

06:01.780 --> 06:02.740
You just woke up.

06:02.740 --> 06:04.060
Your spiritual power is injured

06:04.060 --> 06:05.660
and you are still quite weak.

06:06.020 --> 06:08.280
You have to eat something no matter what.

06:08.460 --> 06:09.740
Thank you, He Na.

06:10.380 --> 06:11.690
Sorry to bother you again

06:11.690 --> 06:12.900
this time.

06:13.340 --> 06:15.270
I'm happy that you asked me for help

06:16.260 --> 06:17.790
at the most difficult time.

06:21.820 --> 06:22.680
The Moon Sword!

06:24.780 --> 06:25.700
Don't worry.

06:26.380 --> 06:27.820
The Moon Sword is here too.

06:27.820 --> 06:30.180
It's just that it's oppositing the spiritual power in your body.

06:30.180 --> 06:32.180
To prevent you from being devoured,

06:32.460 --> 06:34.659
I used water energy to cast a protection spell on the sword.

06:34.659 --> 06:35.659
It is safe for now.

06:43.340 --> 06:44.250
He Na.

06:46.220 --> 06:47.300
Tell me.

06:48.220 --> 06:49.900
What is his heart made of?

06:51.860 --> 06:53.659
He can pretend to like you

06:55.100 --> 06:56.760
so much that he may die for you.

06:57.420 --> 06:59.500
I never doubted him.

07:00.180 --> 07:01.540
But in the end,

07:02.580 --> 07:04.420
I'm less important than a sword.

07:09.020 --> 07:10.420
If she dies because of me,

07:11.020 --> 07:12.480
I will not live selfishly.

07:13.580 --> 07:16.310
If Master wants to sacrifice an innocent person,

07:17.180 --> 07:19.020
why don't you start with me?

07:22.420 --> 07:24.340
As long as Liu Shao can survive,

07:25.060 --> 07:26.300
God of the Moonlight

07:26.780 --> 07:28.460
has nothing to do with me.

07:33.300 --> 07:34.250
So,

07:34.659 --> 07:36.980
you broke up because of the Moon Sword?

07:50.850 --> 07:51.860
What about you?

07:53.140 --> 07:56.340
You also think all his kindness is fake.

07:59.050 --> 08:00.660
All the things are just a lie.

08:08.580 --> 08:09.910
Since you can't answer,

08:11.580 --> 08:13.710
why don't you find an answer yourself?

08:15.660 --> 08:17.060
Where can I find the answer?

08:17.060 --> 08:17.900
Your heart.

08:26.220 --> 08:28.550
You want to save Liu Shao with your life?

08:36.210 --> 08:37.100
Fine.

08:40.940 --> 08:43.419
Give me back half of your heart first.

08:57.570 --> 09:00.300
There has always been a legend in the demon world.

09:00.380 --> 09:01.860
On the full moon night,

09:02.180 --> 09:03.620
the flute of the Melody Flute

09:03.620 --> 09:05.850
can illuminate a bridge of heart.

09:07.180 --> 09:09.780
As long as you think of the person you want to see the most,

09:09.780 --> 09:11.700
you can walk on the bridge,

09:11.940 --> 09:13.220
walk into the heart,

09:14.500 --> 09:16.570
and find out the answer you want.

09:19.300 --> 09:20.580
Liu Shao.

09:21.140 --> 09:22.420
Liu Shao.

09:29.740 --> 09:31.140
This is for you.

09:36.180 --> 09:37.660
What are you waiting for?

09:37.660 --> 09:38.620
Take it.

09:46.900 --> 09:48.620
You must keep

09:48.980 --> 09:50.620
the gift I gave you.

09:54.220 --> 09:56.550
What you see and hear in the bridge of heart

09:57.060 --> 09:59.100
is also what you think in your heart.

10:18.260 --> 10:19.620
Silly girl,

10:20.060 --> 10:22.180
you're so easily fooled.

10:26.500 --> 10:28.140
No matter how precious you are,

10:28.140 --> 10:30.940
there's no way you can compare with the Moon Sword.

10:42.380 --> 10:44.860
That's the reflection of your heart.

10:46.100 --> 10:48.570
Do you really want to die for her?

10:55.500 --> 10:58.900
Lu Li, we're done.

11:34.140 --> 11:34.860
Liu Shao.

11:36.100 --> 11:36.940
I'm fine.

11:39.210 --> 11:40.420
I am thinking that

11:41.940 --> 11:43.400
he once swore with his life

11:45.300 --> 11:46.330
to protect me

11:47.780 --> 11:48.740
and save me.

11:50.820 --> 11:52.340
What is his true heart?

11:54.060 --> 11:55.580
What can I believe?

11:58.900 --> 12:01.220
This half of heart that you value so much

12:02.820 --> 12:04.820
is full of Liu Shao.

12:21.860 --> 12:22.690
Maybe

12:23.530 --> 12:25.060
he was sincere at that time.

12:26.690 --> 12:28.620
No one can control himself while in love.

12:28.620 --> 12:30.580
He can't be fake at most of the time.

12:39.220 --> 12:40.020
I'm fine.

12:42.380 --> 12:43.440
If he's heartless,

12:44.940 --> 12:45.940
I will give him up.

12:47.420 --> 12:49.220
There's nothing to worry about.

12:51.220 --> 12:52.940
I just need time

12:54.900 --> 12:56.860
to take a break.

12:59.740 --> 13:01.660
I can make it.

13:04.820 --> 13:05.620
Liu Shao.

13:21.460 --> 13:23.100
If I miss you,

13:23.860 --> 13:25.920
I'll regret it for the rest of my life.

13:26.580 --> 13:27.860
Then don't miss me.

14:07.340 --> 14:08.860
You did so much

14:09.900 --> 14:12.100
just to save Liu Shao.

14:18.540 --> 14:21.180
I can't do anything to the injury

14:22.780 --> 14:25.110
caused by the devouring of the Moon Sword.

14:26.540 --> 14:27.300
However,

14:28.260 --> 14:32.220
I heard that the Bone-Corroding Harp of Immortal Ze Shui from the demon world

14:32.220 --> 14:34.100
has strong healing power.

14:38.300 --> 14:40.780
It might help her.

14:46.260 --> 14:47.210
Master...

15:06.100 --> 15:09.940
Rumor has it that the Bone-Corroding Harp has turned into a demon due to hatred

15:09.940 --> 15:11.460
and is very vicious.

15:12.210 --> 15:13.220
You might die

15:14.660 --> 15:15.980
during the trip.

15:16.820 --> 15:17.780
Master.

15:20.340 --> 15:21.580
I once swore

15:22.980 --> 15:25.110
I will love her and protect her forever

15:25.660 --> 15:27.100
and never regret.

15:28.780 --> 15:30.660
Even if I die,

15:31.820 --> 15:32.980
I must save her.

15:35.180 --> 15:35.940
Master,

15:37.260 --> 15:39.460
remember to take your medicine on time.

15:40.980 --> 15:42.060
Take care.

16:10.540 --> 16:11.380
Your Majesty.

16:13.260 --> 16:14.140
I'm fine.

16:14.700 --> 16:17.460
But it is not a long-term solution

16:17.460 --> 16:19.180
to treat Miss Liu with the water energy.

16:19.180 --> 16:21.260
Besides, it's very harmful to you.

16:21.260 --> 16:22.660
You can't use it anymore.

16:23.820 --> 16:26.300
If we still have the Bone-Corroding Harp,

16:26.940 --> 16:28.460
we can save Liu Shao.

16:29.500 --> 16:31.620
If we can find the Bone-Corroding Harp...

16:31.620 --> 16:33.020
It won't work.

16:33.220 --> 16:35.010
It is hid in the wasteland

16:35.340 --> 16:37.820
and full of hatred towards our clan.

16:37.980 --> 16:39.460
If you go to find it,

16:39.460 --> 16:42.220
you will be burned to death.

16:44.410 --> 16:45.420
He Na!

16:46.660 --> 16:47.940
He Na!

16:48.900 --> 16:49.740
Lu Li.

16:53.380 --> 16:54.620
How's Liu Shao doing?

16:54.620 --> 16:57.020
She was hurt both physically and mentally.

16:57.340 --> 16:58.780
How can she be doing well?

17:03.980 --> 17:04.900
It was my fault.

17:05.540 --> 17:07.140
You have nothing to explain?

17:09.220 --> 17:11.329
It was all my fault.

17:11.540 --> 17:13.060
There's nothing to explain.

17:13.060 --> 17:14.260
You didn't betray her

17:15.020 --> 17:16.579
nor want to hurt her.

17:17.260 --> 17:19.790
I tried to stop her from pulling out the sword,

17:20.500 --> 17:21.619
but it was too late.

17:22.819 --> 17:24.880
Something else happened after that.

17:25.569 --> 17:27.230
That made her misunderstand.

17:30.940 --> 17:32.140
Do you want to see her?

17:32.540 --> 17:33.780
Of course.

17:35.660 --> 17:36.540
But

17:38.300 --> 17:39.900
if I go to see her now,

17:40.580 --> 17:42.240
I will only bring her trouble.

17:42.620 --> 17:43.690
I can't control

17:44.180 --> 17:46.180
her injury caused by the devouring.

17:47.020 --> 17:48.180
In a few days,

17:49.060 --> 17:50.340
she may pass away.

17:51.050 --> 17:54.450
So I need to find the Bone-Corroding Harp as soon as possible.

17:55.540 --> 17:57.800
How do you know the Bone-Corroding Harp?

18:32.380 --> 18:34.510
You really deserve your reputation as

18:34.700 --> 18:36.630
the General of the Aquatic Demons.

18:36.850 --> 18:38.090
Fu,

18:38.340 --> 18:40.020
I don't deserve

18:40.980 --> 18:42.980
such a big gift.

18:43.260 --> 18:45.340
You are the famous Mr. Lu Sheng

18:45.820 --> 18:48.150
who once worked with God of the Moonlight.

18:48.780 --> 18:50.540
If I don't bring some gifts at our first meeting,

18:50.540 --> 18:52.340
it may seem that I look down on you

18:53.620 --> 18:55.020
Cut the crap.

18:56.220 --> 18:58.340
Although we are different,

18:58.900 --> 19:00.540
we have the same goal.

19:01.340 --> 19:02.580
I want the Moon Sword.

19:03.090 --> 19:04.460
Can you get it?

19:04.740 --> 19:07.700
As long as you can find the person who broke the Four Seasons Monument,

19:07.700 --> 19:09.220
I'm willing to do it.

19:10.300 --> 19:12.100
I've already found the person.

19:14.080 --> 19:14.870
Good.

19:15.880 --> 19:17.110
Wait for my good news.

19:38.620 --> 19:40.020
The Bone-Corroding Harp

19:40.020 --> 19:42.880
is the magic weapon that Immortal Ze Shui once used.

19:43.540 --> 19:44.820
It can calm one's mind

19:45.300 --> 19:47.700
and heal one's physical and mental trauma.

19:47.740 --> 19:49.600
It can even repair magic weapons.

19:51.260 --> 19:53.320
So where is the Bone-Corroding Harp?

19:55.020 --> 19:56.680
I heard it's in the wasteland.

20:00.420 --> 20:01.950
But for thousands of years,

20:02.340 --> 20:03.600
the world has changed.

20:04.100 --> 20:06.140
The demon world moved mountains to fill the sea.

20:06.140 --> 20:08.300
Ordinary people can't find it.

20:13.490 --> 20:14.750
Then how can we find it?

20:21.700 --> 20:24.300
The Aquatic Demons can feel the Bone-Corroding Harp.

20:24.300 --> 20:25.380
But

20:30.420 --> 20:33.740
we've been cursed by Immortal Ze Shui for generations.

20:34.100 --> 20:35.900
As long as we get close to the Bone-Corroding Harp,

20:35.900 --> 20:37.460
our body will split

20:38.260 --> 20:39.860
and die because of the curse.

20:43.500 --> 20:44.660
What if

20:45.340 --> 20:47.000
I have a way to break the curse?

20:48.860 --> 20:50.100
What is it?

21:01.700 --> 21:03.780
Give me some water energy of the Aquatic Demons.

21:03.780 --> 21:05.820
I can use the pain to feel the direction

21:05.820 --> 21:06.820
and find the harp.

21:07.900 --> 21:09.300
Do you know how painful it is

21:09.300 --> 21:10.180
when your skin splits inch by inch?

21:10.180 --> 21:11.020
He Na.

21:11.300 --> 21:12.300
Don't waste time.

21:12.580 --> 21:13.460
She can't wait.

21:46.300 --> 21:47.170
Liu Shao.

21:47.610 --> 21:48.500
Wait for me.

21:49.290 --> 21:50.900
I will find it.

21:51.500 --> 21:52.420
Liu Shao.

21:53.100 --> 21:54.060
Wait for me.

22:30.380 --> 22:32.580
I wonder what would my brother look like

22:32.700 --> 22:34.660
if I strangle you to death?

22:37.020 --> 22:38.700
When I find the Moon Sword,

22:38.700 --> 22:40.100
I won't keep you alive.

23:09.980 --> 23:10.740
Fu,

23:13.460 --> 23:15.460
you are doing useless things again.

23:16.740 --> 23:17.820
Since young,

23:18.380 --> 23:21.060
you've put your most important things here.

23:21.380 --> 23:23.510
Even the protection spell is the same.

23:23.540 --> 23:24.600
No one can touch it,

23:24.660 --> 23:25.820
except you.

23:26.130 --> 23:27.460
Since you already knew,

23:27.700 --> 23:30.060
why did you try again and again?

23:31.340 --> 23:33.200
Because I overestimated myself.

23:33.580 --> 23:35.700
I thought maybe in your heart,

23:35.820 --> 23:37.050
I am different.

23:39.300 --> 23:40.140
The Moon Sword

23:40.740 --> 23:42.600
is not something we should touch.

23:42.860 --> 23:44.780
It's not something we can touch?

23:45.300 --> 23:46.760
Then who does it belong to?

23:46.970 --> 23:49.500
Immortal Palace? Marquis Wuyang's Mansion?

23:49.860 --> 23:51.590
Or Liu Shao who is lying inside?

23:52.340 --> 23:54.260
I once thought since she could pull out the Moon Sword,

23:54.260 --> 23:55.530
she should be capable.

23:56.500 --> 23:58.260
But now she's dying.

23:58.540 --> 23:59.700
Other than causing you more troubles,

23:59.700 --> 24:00.830
what else can she do?

24:02.150 --> 24:02.930
Get out.

24:04.940 --> 24:07.580
You kicked me out for a woman?

24:25.060 --> 24:25.570
What?

24:25.980 --> 24:27.420
How could your demon energy be injured?

24:27.420 --> 24:28.280
What happened?

24:30.210 --> 24:30.900
Fu,

24:31.620 --> 24:32.930
you are not allowed

24:33.420 --> 24:35.420
to touch Liu Shao and the Moon Sword.

24:53.220 --> 24:54.780
This is the energy-mixing pill we got

24:54.780 --> 24:56.710
after we obtained the spirit fire.

24:57.380 --> 24:59.340
Maybe it can help her regain some magic power

24:59.340 --> 25:01.180
to resist the injury caused by the devouring.

25:01.180 --> 25:02.310
You're injured too.

25:02.860 --> 25:04.660
And this trip is full of danger.

25:05.260 --> 25:06.660
This energy-mixing pill

25:06.900 --> 25:08.260
might be more useful to you.

25:08.260 --> 25:09.540
I am tough.

25:10.210 --> 25:11.670
I may not need these at all.

25:13.740 --> 25:15.020
Give this to her.

25:15.620 --> 25:16.540
In the future,

25:16.880 --> 25:18.420
please take care of her.

25:27.580 --> 25:28.220
Lu Li.

25:34.100 --> 25:35.500
You must come back alive.

25:37.700 --> 25:38.380
I will.

25:40.170 --> 25:41.970
I know someone is waiting for me.

26:28.340 --> 26:29.940
I hope this pill from Lu Li

26:30.900 --> 26:32.690
can give you some more time.

26:39.710 --> 26:43.950
[Ice Rock Lake]

27:22.980 --> 27:24.580
The water energy is working.

27:25.500 --> 27:26.700
The more painful I am,

27:27.620 --> 27:30.080
the closer I get to the Bone-Corroding Harp.

28:13.380 --> 28:15.040
You accepted my water energy.

28:15.940 --> 28:17.020
From now on,

28:17.700 --> 28:20.020
every time you get one inch closer to the Bone-Corroding Harp,

28:20.020 --> 28:22.280
your vitality will be weakened a little.

28:23.580 --> 28:25.690
If you want to get the Bone-Corroding Harp,

28:25.690 --> 28:28.060
you need to be prepared to risk your life.

29:04.370 --> 29:05.170
You're awake.

29:08.380 --> 29:10.510
Did I fall asleep for a long time again?

29:12.750 --> 29:13.580
Not long.

29:16.710 --> 29:17.840
You're lying again.

29:20.260 --> 29:21.860
Every time you lie,

29:22.140 --> 29:23.270
you don't talk much,

29:23.580 --> 29:24.780
never wasting a word.

29:25.370 --> 29:28.060
And you also lean to the left like this.

29:28.340 --> 29:30.070
You can be seen through easily.

29:32.060 --> 29:33.120
I'll write it down.

29:35.500 --> 29:36.780
When it comes to lying,

29:36.780 --> 29:38.310
you should learn from Lu Li.

29:38.860 --> 29:40.140
Be confident

29:40.900 --> 29:42.620
and be convincing.

29:42.860 --> 29:43.940
Once,

29:43.940 --> 29:45.060
Lu Li and I...

29:52.180 --> 29:54.340
It's great that I can wake up.

29:55.940 --> 29:57.660
When I fell asleep,

29:58.420 --> 30:00.300
I thought I wouldn't wake up.

30:07.540 --> 30:08.210
Liu Shao.

30:10.620 --> 30:12.020
If you fall asleep again,

30:12.500 --> 30:14.030
you have to remind yourself

30:14.060 --> 30:15.260
that you must wake up.

30:16.020 --> 30:17.420
There is someone who cherishes you,

30:17.420 --> 30:18.290
loves you,

30:19.180 --> 30:20.310
and values your life

30:21.180 --> 30:22.540
more than his.

30:23.300 --> 30:24.810
Do you mean my parents?

30:25.380 --> 30:26.640
There is someone else.

30:28.380 --> 30:29.620
Do you mean you?

30:30.780 --> 30:32.240
Although you are my demon,

30:32.380 --> 30:33.650
but I can't afford

30:33.940 --> 30:35.260
such a powerful demon

30:36.140 --> 30:37.540
like you, the Demon King.

30:37.780 --> 30:39.440
How about me setting you free?

30:43.020 --> 30:43.860
I mean...

30:46.250 --> 30:46.940
Lu Li.

30:48.660 --> 30:49.720
Don't mention him.

30:51.660 --> 30:53.790
I should still have several days left.

30:55.180 --> 30:56.220
Let me

30:58.340 --> 30:59.300
feel the world

31:01.140 --> 31:03.420
wholeheartedly.

31:05.420 --> 31:06.950
Actually, you could woke up

31:07.780 --> 31:09.660
because Lu Li gave you a pill.

31:10.700 --> 31:12.360
It was given by Marquis Wuyang

31:12.660 --> 31:13.860
after you obtained the spirit fire.

31:13.860 --> 31:15.220
It's hot.

31:21.700 --> 31:22.760
Show me your hands.

31:27.300 --> 31:29.030
Look how badly you are injured.

31:29.860 --> 31:31.390
He was injured at that time.

31:32.100 --> 31:33.430
And he is going to a place

31:33.820 --> 31:35.580
that may kill him.

31:41.420 --> 31:43.820
He's going to get the Bone-Corroding Harp.

31:44.100 --> 31:44.700
That harp

31:45.290 --> 31:46.750
should be able to save you.

31:46.900 --> 31:47.660
Save me?

31:48.580 --> 31:51.740
The Bone-Corroding Harp hates the Aquatic Demons the most

31:51.740 --> 31:54.140
so Lu Li asked me for some of my water energy.

31:54.530 --> 31:57.220
He relies on the pain he feels when getting close to the harp

31:57.220 --> 31:58.820
to determine the location.

32:01.100 --> 32:02.820
The pain he's suffering now

32:03.420 --> 32:05.350
is a thousand times more than mine.

32:07.060 --> 32:09.180
I'm not sure if he can get the Bone-Corroding Harp.

32:09.180 --> 32:10.260
I'm not even sure

32:12.260 --> 32:13.420
if he can survive

32:14.340 --> 32:16.670
when he reaches the Bone-Corroding Harp.

32:20.660 --> 32:21.660
When he came to me,

32:22.340 --> 32:23.670
he only cared about you.

32:24.140 --> 32:25.340
As for the Moon Sword,

32:25.940 --> 32:27.290
he never mentioned it.

32:33.140 --> 32:34.580
Can you send me to him?

32:54.900 --> 32:56.630
Lu Li has my water energy on him.

32:57.620 --> 32:59.030
With it as the introduction

32:59.030 --> 33:01.100
and the power of the Brahma tree as the guide,

33:01.100 --> 33:03.100
I can send you to him immediately.

33:04.260 --> 33:06.220
But if your injury relapses there,

33:08.140 --> 33:09.300
no one can save you.

33:11.410 --> 33:12.820
Even if I die,

33:13.540 --> 33:14.460
I must go.

33:15.500 --> 33:16.760
I want to ask him again.

33:17.740 --> 33:19.540
Is the Moon Sword more important

33:20.420 --> 33:21.500
or me?

33:22.060 --> 33:23.610
Since you've made up your mind,

33:23.610 --> 33:24.700
I can't stop you.

33:25.620 --> 33:26.620
But promise me,

33:27.740 --> 33:28.740
you and Lu Li

33:29.780 --> 33:30.980
must come back alive.

34:15.380 --> 34:16.840
The Bone-Corroding Harp.

34:33.739 --> 34:35.400
Looks like Liu Shao was wrong.

34:35.850 --> 34:37.580
If you only want to use Liu Shao,

34:38.170 --> 34:40.969
why would you risk your life to go to the wasteland?

34:42.139 --> 34:44.580
But you have to be careful of your Soul-Devouring Spell.

34:44.580 --> 34:47.510
If you want to save Liu Shao, you must come back alive.

35:01.940 --> 35:03.060
I can't die yet.

35:04.650 --> 35:05.260
Liu Shao.

35:09.620 --> 35:11.170
Liu Shao is waiting for me.

35:17.260 --> 35:18.180
Liu Shao.

35:22.540 --> 35:23.580
Liu Shao.

35:28.540 --> 35:29.650
Liu Shao.

35:39.340 --> 35:40.540
Liu Shao.

35:48.770 --> 35:49.610
Liu Shao.

35:51.020 --> 35:52.460
I won't let you die.

35:53.340 --> 35:54.500
I won't.

35:56.540 --> 35:57.620
Prove it to me.

36:00.700 --> 36:01.580
Prove it?

36:03.260 --> 36:04.060
Okay.

36:05.340 --> 36:06.410
I will save you.

36:07.340 --> 36:08.580
I can't give up.

36:09.940 --> 36:11.940
I will get the Bone-Corroding Harp.

36:13.300 --> 36:14.900
Get the Bone-Corroding Harp

36:17.660 --> 36:18.340
and save...

36:19.580 --> 36:20.820
Save Liu Shao.

36:21.740 --> 36:22.340
Lu Li.

36:53.380 --> 36:54.060
Liu Shao?

36:55.370 --> 36:56.180
Is that you?

36:57.580 --> 36:58.580
Is it really you?

37:00.180 --> 37:01.540
Am I dreaming?

37:03.060 --> 37:04.610
I have a lot to tell you.

37:05.780 --> 37:07.970
I stopped you from pulling out the Moon Sword

37:07.970 --> 37:10.770
because I didn't want you to get hurt because of it.

37:10.820 --> 37:11.660
If I'm gone,

37:12.860 --> 37:14.060
you must forget me.

37:15.460 --> 37:16.100
Liu Shao.

37:17.740 --> 37:18.340
I like you.

37:27.500 --> 37:28.060
Lu Li.

37:29.580 --> 37:31.440
Look carefully if this is a dream.

37:42.180 --> 37:42.850
Liu Shao.

37:44.820 --> 37:46.140
Why are you here?

37:47.180 --> 37:49.040
Because I have a question for you.

37:50.740 --> 37:51.620
But just now,

37:53.180 --> 37:54.500
you have answered it.

37:57.300 --> 37:58.300
Do you believe me?

38:00.620 --> 38:01.330
I do.

38:02.620 --> 38:03.180
Lu Li.

38:04.460 --> 38:07.060
Even if I don't believe in my eyes and ears,

38:08.460 --> 38:09.900
I will believe you.

38:11.410 --> 38:13.470
No matter what happens in the future,

38:13.860 --> 38:15.260
let's face it together.

38:15.660 --> 38:16.180
OK.

38:33.220 --> 38:34.820
The Bone-Corroding Harp...

38:36.140 --> 38:37.450
What is it saying to me?

38:38.980 --> 38:40.040
It said it hates...

38:40.220 --> 38:40.980
Liu Shao!

38:42.220 --> 38:43.020
Liu Shao!

38:51.460 --> 38:52.520
Protection spell?

39:01.210 --> 39:02.420
What's going on?

39:02.500 --> 39:03.660
Liu Shao!

39:06.100 --> 39:07.180
The man outside

39:07.780 --> 39:09.140
has betrayed you.

39:10.020 --> 39:10.650
But you

39:11.220 --> 39:13.260
still have hope for him.

39:14.650 --> 39:15.540
Remember,

39:16.460 --> 39:18.010
all men in this world

39:18.260 --> 39:20.180
are liars.

39:22.860 --> 39:24.020
Look.

39:25.140 --> 39:27.050
He wants to keep lying to you.

39:28.340 --> 39:31.300
Look at that traitor's face.

39:35.900 --> 39:36.940
Kill him.

39:39.380 --> 39:40.490
Kill him!

39:42.820 --> 39:44.460
Kill him.

39:46.680 --> 39:47.410
Liu Shao.

39:49.420 --> 39:51.260
Don't listen to his sweet words.

39:51.980 --> 39:53.700
He just wants to use you.

39:54.220 --> 39:55.500
Kill him!

39:56.500 --> 39:57.020
Kill him!

39:57.020 --> 39:57.580
Liu Shao.

40:02.420 --> 40:02.780
Liu Shao!

40:02.780 --> 40:03.740
Don't hesitate.

40:04.140 --> 40:04.620
Do it!

40:04.620 --> 40:05.300
Liu Shao!

40:05.740 --> 40:07.660
The liar deserves to die!

40:08.180 --> 40:08.780
Liu Shao!

40:09.140 --> 40:09.890
Kill him!

40:11.060 --> 40:12.260
Liu Shao!

40:17.780 --> 40:18.580
Lu Li!

40:23.940 --> 40:24.900
One more time.

40:25.500 --> 40:27.380
You can injure him badly.

40:27.810 --> 40:28.330
No.

40:28.350 --> 40:29.940
Let him pay the price.

40:30.300 --> 40:32.560
Let him experience the feeling of dying.

40:35.740 --> 40:36.900
I believe Lu Li.

40:37.260 --> 40:38.860
He has never betrayed me.

40:39.140 --> 40:41.660
Even if I don't believe in my eyes and ears,

40:41.860 --> 40:42.940
I will believe him.

40:44.180 --> 40:46.580
You are just the resentment left in the harp

40:46.580 --> 40:50.020
by Immortal Ze Shui.

40:50.500 --> 40:53.300
No, you can't be trusted.

41:04.460 --> 41:06.100
I have my own choice.

41:26.370 --> 41:27.100
Liu Shao.

41:30.340 --> 41:30.870
Liu Shao.

41:30.900 --> 41:31.580
Lu Li.

41:36.060 --> 41:36.790
Are you okay?

41:37.700 --> 41:38.180
Lu Li.

41:44.980 --> 41:46.710
I got the Bone-Corroding Harp.

41:48.470 --> 41:49.500
I saw it.

41:50.930 --> 41:53.740
The spiritual power left by Immortal Ze Shui has disappeared.

41:53.740 --> 41:55.540
It can't hurt the Aquatic Demons

41:55.820 --> 41:56.900
or me.

41:58.380 --> 42:00.840
But its healing power should still be there.

42:04.380 --> 42:05.300
Just now,

42:06.820 --> 42:08.740
I think I saw Immortal Ze Shui.

42:10.980 --> 42:12.860
I gave the harp to her.

42:13.900 --> 42:14.460
No.

42:15.140 --> 42:15.870
It wasn't me.

42:17.860 --> 42:18.390
Liu Shao.

42:18.800 --> 42:19.420
Liu Shao.

42:20.820 --> 42:21.900
You're too tired.

42:23.340 --> 42:25.410
You still have the injury casued by the devouring.

42:25.410 --> 42:26.300
Now,

42:27.910 --> 42:29.770
you have to go back for treatment.

42:31.290 --> 42:32.690
It's too dangerous here.

42:34.900 --> 42:37.700
We were separated by the protection spell just now

42:37.700 --> 42:39.160
so I couldn't protect you.

42:39.500 --> 42:40.900
You can't get hurt again.

42:41.220 --> 42:42.180
That voice

42:44.340 --> 42:45.400
was full of hatred.

42:47.620 --> 42:49.150
I don't want that to happen.

42:51.060 --> 42:53.060
I don't want anything magnificent.

42:53.740 --> 42:55.900
I just want to live with you forever.

43:09.060 --> 43:10.500
But I'm afraid

43:11.060 --> 43:13.380
I can't be with you forever.

43:13.380 --> 43:16.420
When the curse mark return to your palm,

43:14.030 --> 43:17.140
♫On rainy days, wind blows smoke♫

43:16.940 --> 43:18.660
you will die for sure

43:17.140 --> 43:19.230
♫Into circles♫

43:20.360 --> 43:23.210
♫On both sides, I’m chanting♫

43:22.130 --> 43:23.900
Even for one day.

43:23.510 --> 43:25.310
♫The night is sleepless♫

43:26.620 --> 43:29.630
♫The shadows of the moon are incomplete, and people are in love♫

43:28.010 --> 43:28.540
Okay.

43:29.770 --> 43:31.940
♫A cocoon of shadows♫

43:30.570 --> 43:32.100
Let's be an ordinary couple

43:32.380 --> 43:37.760
♫Your promise, my fate♫

43:33.560 --> 43:35.560
who live an ordinary and happy life.

43:39.330 --> 43:42.550
♫In spring, seasons changed♫

43:41.220 --> 43:41.780
Liu Shao.

43:42.560 --> 43:44.600
♫But my heart is still the same♫

43:43.230 --> 43:44.300
Can you hold on?

43:45.690 --> 43:48.760
♫Back to the sky, the clouds passing by♫

43:46.740 --> 43:48.140
Of course I can.

43:48.760 --> 43:50.330
♫Is like the things we went through♫

43:48.770 --> 43:50.180
Let's find He Na

43:50.820 --> 43:52.140
to fix the Bone-Corroding Harp first.

43:51.980 --> 43:54.660
♫Beside the lake, on the boat♫

43:55.050 --> 43:56.980
♫The moment we passed each other♫

43:57.670 --> 44:03.390
♫Can compare with the rest of my life♫

44:03.770 --> 44:09.090
♫I look at my love and send it to the clouds outside the garden♫

44:10.050 --> 44:16.090
♫Looking at your ageless face at the end of the world♫

44:16.490 --> 44:22.720
♫You put the winter snow in your ears and can’t hear it♫

44:22.720 --> 44:28.920
♫When the flowers stop falling, you and I will miss each other♫

44:28.920 --> 44:33.850
♫Everything in the world passes before understanding♫

44:30.980 --> 44:33.960
[The Song of the Moon]
